import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'miswired':('The greater acid bolt that never counted',
  'A mage wears a ring carrying the ACID_BOLT3 activation and faces a kobold. The ACID_BOLT3 maneuver looks up the ACID_BOLT2 activation id, so the item is never considered: the maneuver is valued at zero. The correction looks up the id the maneuver describes, and the ring is valued like the correctly-wired lesser bolt in the control.'),
 'control':('Control: the correctly-wired lesser bolt',
  'The same mage wears a ring carrying the ACID_BOLT2 activation, whose maneuver is wired correctly. It is valued identically before and after the correction, and the complete log is byte-identical: the fix changes only the miswired lookups.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/activ-260 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag in ('GEOMETRY ','RATING ','OUTCOME '):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[tag.split()[0].lower()]=match[1].strip() if match else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>The activation that never counted</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native activation-maneuver valuations</p><h1>The activation that never counted</h1><p>Two attack maneuvers look up the wrong activation ids. The ACID_BOLT3 maneuver checked whether the Borg carries the ACID_BOLT2 activation: an item with the greater bolt was never considered, and with the lesser one worn it was borrowed at the greater bolt damage. The DISPEL_ALL maneuver checked the dispel-undead activation: an item with the all-monsters dispel was never considered either. The correction looks up the ids the maneuvers already describe.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">Maneuver value</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the control establishes</h2><p>The correctly-wired lesser-bolt maneuver values its ring identically before and after, with byte-identical logs: the fix changes only the miswired lookups, not the valuation machinery.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Mage level forty-one, depth thirty, seed one thousand, lit constructed arena, a worn ring whose activation is set to the table ACID_BOLT3 entry (or ACID_BOLT2 in the control), charged, and an adjacent awake kobold. The measurement calls the public maneuver chooser with borg_simulate set. In stock data these activations attach to randomly generated artifacts, so the reachability is randart-games; the lookup defect itself is measured directly. The dispel token of the correction is the same one-line shape and is verified by reading; its maneuver reaches its item after the correction. This isolates the lookup ids, not full autonomous play. No death or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/260">issue260</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);let r=d.rating||'';let m=r.match(/bolt3=(-?\\d+)/);p.querySelector('.num').textContent='Greater bolt: '+(m?m[1]:(r.match(/bolt2=(-?\\d+)/)||['','n/a'])[1]);p.querySelector('.state').textContent=d.outcome||'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='miswired'?'The original values the greater-bolt maneuver at 0 - the item is never considered; the correction values it at 52.':'The lesser bolt is wired correctly: 52 either way, byte for byte.';}select.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
